  "details": "On live, if you have a trigger with a delay, calling it will check if it should execute the trigger based on disabled status at the time of the call. In beta, this was changed to check if it should execute until after the delay has finished. \nExample world: \nwrld_0d863ace-31fa-41f9-a411-5e9cc59542e8\nTop row is actual behavior, bottom row is expected behavior. \nLive:\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/449386885299830794/694792493761298482/unknown.png\nBeta:\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/449386885299830794/694792504209571901/unknown.png",
